{"id": "v08", "call_trace": ["search_policy"], "tool_calls": [{"name": "search_policy", "args": {"k": 1, "query": "interest charges for on-time payments"}, "result": "[{'type': 'text', 'text': '{\"results\":[{\"doc\":\"10-fees-overview\",\"heading\":\"Fees Overview\",\"text\":\"| Fee | Amount | When |\\\\n|---|---|---|\\\\n| Failed-payment fee | $10 | Second failed charge attempt on an installment |\\\\n| Reschedule fee | $5 | Second and third reschedule on an order (first is free) |\\\\n| Account reactivation fee | $10 | Reactivating after 30+ days deactivated |\\\\n| Interest | $0 | Sezzle pay-in-4 never charges interest |\\\\n\\\\nSezzle charges **no interest and no fee for paying on time**. Fee amounts are fixed;\\\\nsupport assistants must not offer discounts or ad-hoc waivers (see Failed Payments\\\\nfor the one automatic waiver rule).\",\"score\":0.0325}]}', 'id': 'lc_e920852e-e7ec-40d7-8596-51afa76267bb'}]"}]}
